    "limitations": [
      "Fresh native installation/edit/setup/export proof uses PHP APIs; four fresh visual admin installation/editor workflows were not rerun. Earlier browser-native UI proof is historical and separately scoped.",
      "WordPress.com plan/upload permissions and real Apache/nginx/managed-host behavior remain untested.",
      "Phone User-Agent HTTP checks are not visual mobile-browser or physical-phone proof for these native runtime sites.",
      "Contact actions verify ordinary links and edited mailto hrefs only; no email app opened or message/form/booking/payment delivered. Task runtime suppresses wp_mail.",
